title: "gwbench: A Reproducible Benchmark for Groundwater-Level Forecasting"
abstract: "A reproducible benchmark for daily groundwater-level forecasting using public USGS NWIS data, with persistence baselines, a residual GRU, per-site persistence blending, and missing-data stress tests."
